# The completeness track carries the same conditions, because the honest
# prover's witness needs them. Lemma 5's forward direction — the one that
# produces multiplicities — normalizes by the table-side count, so it is the
# completeness leg that needs those counts invertible; and a witness indexed
# by a table of one length is not a witness for a table of another. An
# artifact the soundness track refuses must not be priced here either.
# RUN: %python %S/../Evidence/Inputs/retarget_request.py %S/Inputs/logup-range-check-completeness-request.json %t/mult.artifacts %t/mult.comp.json
# RUN: not zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
